ether from real found  footage but perhaps the most successful  thing about the film is its ambiguity  it's really just a trio of campers in  the woods hearing noises and coming  across weird ritualistic totems The  Witches never seen and the ending is a  little confusing but sometimes the best  films are the ones that keep us guessing  check out our newest videos right here  plus even more looper videos about your  favorite horror movies are coming soon  subscribe to our YouTube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]

